1
00:00:00,154 --> 00:00:01,424
(Sheldon:)I'll be right across the hall.

2
00:00:01,422 --> 00:00:03,592
(Sheldon:)You'll probably be able
to hear it.

3
00:00:05,793 --> 00:00:07,063
(Leonard:)Keep the clock, Sheldon.

4
00:00:07,061 --> 00:00:08,191
(Howard:)Thank you.

5
00:00:08,195 --> 00:00:10,795
(Howard:)Thank you.
Thank you?

6
00:00:11,665 --> 00:00:13,395
(Sheldon:)Oh, now...

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,330
(Sheldon:)what about

8
00:00:15,336 --> 00:00:16,806
(Sheldon:)our 3-D chess set?

9
00:00:16,804 --> 00:00:17,874
(Leonard:)Let me guess, you want it.

10
00:00:17,871 --> 00:00:19,171
(Sheldon:)Well, no,

11
00:00:19,173 --> 00:00:20,843
(Sheldon:)I just didn't think you'd want
a physical reminder

12
00:00:20,841 --> 00:00:23,571
(Sheldon:)of a game you never
managed to win.

13
00:00:23,577 --> 00:00:26,007
(Sheldon:)As a kindness, I should probably
take all the games.

14
00:00:26,013 --> 00:00:28,413
(Leonard:)You know what, Sheldon, take it.

15
00:00:28,415 --> 00:00:29,985
(Leonard:)In fact, you can
have everything.

16
00:00:29,983 --> 00:00:31,413
(Leonard:)I really don't care.

17
00:00:31,652 --> 00:00:33,422
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?

18
00:00:33,421 --> 00:00:36,251
(Sheldon:)These items represent
our shared times together.

19
00:00:36,257 --> 00:00:37,757
(Leonard:)Well, now they're yours.
Leonard....

20
00:00:37,758 --> 00:00:39,088
(Leonard:)Well, you know
what's gonna happen.

21
00:00:39,093 --> 00:00:40,363
(Leonard:)He's just gonna come up
with some reason

22
00:00:40,361 --> 00:00:41,831
(Leonard:)why everything should be his.

23
00:00:41,829 --> 00:00:43,699
(Sheldon:)For a man so good
at predicting my moves,

24
00:00:43,698 --> 00:00:45,728
(Sheldon:)how come you stink at 3-D chess?

25
00:00:46,834 --> 00:00:49,464
Sheldon, you're-you're being
a little selfish.

26
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,740
(Amy:)Why don't you let Leonard
keep a few things?

27
00:00:51,739 --> 00:00:53,039
(Sheldon:)It's not my fault
I'm bad at sharing;

28
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,840
(Sheldon:)I skipped kindergarten.

29
00:00:54,842 --> 00:00:56,442
(Leonard:)You know what?

30
00:00:56,444 --> 00:00:59,024
(Leonard:)There is one thing I would like.

